-2f3c7011adc5" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="0459ef58-9c85-4eb8-878e-92541f5e0f27"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_7r2_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="0459ef58-9c85-4eb8-878e-92541f5e0f27" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="1" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="0459ef58-9c85-4eb8-878e-92541f5e0f27"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">حتماً. بسته آماده را برای Deploy دستی در Cloudflare در اختیارت می‌گذارم.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">پیشنهاد امن:</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> ابتدا روی </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Preview</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> منتشر کن، نه دامنه اصلی؛ چون اتصال APIهای فرم و چت به Worker فعال هنوز تأیید نشده است. انتشار Frontend به‌تنهایی به معنی فعال بودن CRM یا ثبت Lead نیست.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="Box-qIMv6G Pressable-KyqH6M" data-d-component="pressable" data-d-direction="col" data-d-inline="" aria-label="Open دریافت بسته 2020KHODA Frontend Candidate" role="link" tabindex="0" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); display: inline;"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline=""><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted" style="color: inherit;"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">دریافت بسته 2020KHODA Frontend </span></span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-has-width="true" data-d-inline="" style="color: inherit; width: max-content;"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted" style="color: inherit;"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Candidate</span></span><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" data-rtl-flip="" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);" data-d-stream-inline=""><path d="M16.2256 6.99994C16.6534 7 17 7.34654 17 7.77436V14.817C17 15.2449 16.6534 15.5914 16.2256 15.5915C15.7977 15.5915 15.4512 15.2449 15.4512 14.817V9.6437L8.32182 16.773C8.0193 17.0756 7.52944 17.0755 7.2269 16.773C6.92437 16.4705 6.92437 15.9807 7.2269 15.6781L14.3562 8.54878H9.1829C8.75505 8.54878 8.40848 8.20221 8.40848 7.77436C8.40848 7.34651 8.75505 6.99994 9.1829 6.99994H16.2256Z"></path></svg></span></span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">محتویات ZIP بررسی شد؛ شامل <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">index.html</code>، تصویر اصلی، README و گزارش Validation است.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">یک نکته مهم:</span> اگر سایت فعلی با Cloudflare Worker اجرا می‌شود، نباید بدون بررسی یک Pages مستقل برای دامنه اصلی بسازیم؛ چون ممکن است مسیرهای <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">/api/lead</code> و <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">/api/public/chat</code> از Worker جدا شوند.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">نوبت شما — فقط یک مورد را مشخص کن:</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">پروژه فعلی در داشبورد Cloudflare کجا قرار دارد؟</p><ul class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">Workers &amp; Pages → Workers</code></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">Workers &amp; Pages → Pages</code></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">هنوز هیچ پروژه‌ای ساخته نشده</p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">با همین پاسخ، مراحل دقیق Deploy متناسب با معماری فعلی را می‌دهم؛ بدون تغییر ناخواسته در Production یا DNS.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">بسم الله 2020خدا</p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.